        "original_id": "98526bb8-7b1a-5d17-8ad6-79e07fc45307",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Samuel Alito, George W. Bush\n- Cases: Christopher v. SmithKline Beecham Corp.\n- Roles: sales representatives, outside salesmen\n- Organizations: Supreme Court, Department of Labor\n\nFacts:\n- On January 31, 2006, Samuel Alito began serving on the Supreme Court after being nominated by President George W. Bush.\n- In Christopher v. SmithKline Beecham Corp., a majority opinion written by Justice Samuel Alito ruled that sales representatives were \"outside salesmen\" exempt from Department of Labor overtime regulations.",
